      "outputText": "=== n=13 TEXT: from now on, ahve the boy in the picture stay a bit above the horizon line\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"from\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"now\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"on\" discourse=\"ahve\" verb=\"stay\" subject=$n2 complement=$n4\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"boy\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$n2 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"picture\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"bit\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"above\" from=$n4 to=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"horizon\" head=\"line\"\n\n=== n=14 TEXT: I'd like a black bird up above the house there\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"'d\" verb=\"like\" modifier=\"up\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"black\" head=\"bird\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"above\" from=$n2 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"house\" dependent=\"there\"\n\n=== n=15 TEXT: I also need you to set Reject left of Archive so that someone reading from left to right reaches Reject last\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"also\" verb=\"need\" subject=$n1\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$c2\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"set\" modifier=\"left\" subject=$n2 complement=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"Reject\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$c2 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"Archive\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"so that\" from=$c2 to=$c4\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"someone\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"reading\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"from\" from=$c3 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal head=\"left\"\n   @r5 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"to\" from=$c3 to=$n7\n   @n7 syntax.nominal head=\"right\"\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"reaches\" modifier=\"last\" subject=$n5 complement=$n8\n   @n8 syntax.nominal head=\"Reject\"\n   @r6 syntax.relation from=$n5 to=$c3\n\n=== n=16 TEXT: the dog on the path in front of the hill: face left\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"dog\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"path\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$n2 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"front\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n3 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"hill\"\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"face\" dependent=\"left\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n5\n\n=== n=17 TEXT: Describe how order value moved over the quarter\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"Describe\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"how\" verb=\"moved\" subject=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"order\" head=\"value\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"over\" from=$c2 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"quarter\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n\n=== n=18 TEXT: sidee the green block one space left and a quarter space up but never touching the blue block\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"sidee\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"green\" head=\"block\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"one\" head=\"space\" dependent=\"left\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n3 conjunct=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"quarter\" head=\"space\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=nonfinite modifier=\"up\" negation=\"never\" verb=\"touching\" complement=$n5\n   @k2 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"but\" conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c1\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"blue\" head=\"block\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1\n   @r1 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$k1\n\n=== n=19 TEXT: half the stand-up was grumbling that the numbers were impossible to read from the corridor screen; to settle it, go for marker spacing wider on the order scatter — while you're at it, have the error bars magenta going forward and then show both grid lines\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"half\" auxiliary=\"was\" verb=\"grumbling\" subject=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"stand-up\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"that\" from=$c1 to=$c2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"numbers\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"were\" modifier=\"impossible\" subject=$n2\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c2 to=$c3\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"read\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"from\" from=$c3 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"corridor\" head=\"screen\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c5 to=$c4\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"settle\" complement=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @c5 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"go\"\n   @r5 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c5 to=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"marker\" head=\"spacing\" dependent=\"wider\"\n   @r6 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$n5 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"order\" head=\"scatter\"\n   @r7 syntax.relation marker=\"while\" from=$c7 to=$c6\n   @n7 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n   @c6 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"'re\" subject=$n7\n   @r8 syntax.relation marker=\"at\" from=$c6 to=$n8\n   @n8 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @c7 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"have\" modifier=\"magenta\" complement=$n9\n   @n9 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"error\" head=\"bars\"\n   @c8 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"going\" modifier=\"forward\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c5 conjunct=$c7 conjunct=$c9\n   @c9 syntax.clause form=imperative modifier=\"then\" verb=\"show\" complement=$n10\n   @n10 syntax.nominal dependent=\"both\" dependent=\"grid\" head=\"lines\"\n   @r9 syntax.relation from=$c7 to=$c8\n\n=== n=20 TEXT: the top right corner needs to stay clear, just the way the drawing looks\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"top\" dependent=\"right\" head=\"corner\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"needs\" subject=$n1\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$c2\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"stay\" modifier=\"clear\" complement=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"just\" dependent=\"the\" head=\"way\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"drawing\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"looks\" subject=$n3\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$c3\n\n=== n=21 TEXT: for the order system, keep the associations labelled 1..*, then add a multiplicity note to the customer end, with enough space between the parts\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"order\" head=\"system\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"keep\" complement=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"associations\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"labelled\" complement=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"1\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"*\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"then\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c3\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"add\" complement=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"multiplicity\" head=\"note\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c3 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"customer\" head=\"end\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$c3 to=$n7\n   @n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"enough\" head=\"space\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"between\" from=$n7 to=$n8\n   @n8 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"parts\"\n   @r5 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$c2\n   @r6 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$n4\n\n=== n=22 TEXT: please est the Shell block into the upper right corner, three and a half widths in from the right and two lengths down from the top, next keep every other block as it is\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Shell\" head=\"block\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"into\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"upper\" dependent=\"right\" head=\"corner\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"three\" dependent=\"and\" dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"half\" head=\"widths\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"please\" modifier=\"est\" modifier=\"in\" discourse=\"and\" modifier=\"down\" modifier=\"next\" verb=\"keep\" complement=$n1 complement=$n3 complement=$n5 complement=$n7\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"from\" from=$c1 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"right\"\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"two\" head=\"lengths\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"from\" from=$c1 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"top\"\n   @n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"every\" dependent=\"other\" head=\"block\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"as\" from=$c1 to=$c2\n   @n8 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"is\" subject=$n8\n\n=== n=23 TEXT: I keep squinting at Revenue trend every time I paste it into the weekly newsletter; this week, make the line medium width as well, would you. and then make the markers a bit bigger\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"keep\" subject=$n1\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"squinting\" complement=$n3\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"at\" from=$c2 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Revenue\" head=\"trend\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"every\" head=\"time\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"paste\" subject=$n4 complement=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"into\" from=$c3 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"weekly\" head=\"newsletter\"\n   @n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"this\" head=\"week\"\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"make\" modifier=\"as\" modifier=\"well\" complement=$n7 complement=$n8\n   @n8 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"line\" dependent=\"medium\" head=\"width\"\n   @c5 syntax.clause form=interrogative verb=\"would\" subject=$n9\n   @n9 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c4 conjunct=$c6\n   @c6 syntax.clause form=imperative modifier=\"then\" verb=\"make\" modifier=\"bigger\" complement=$n10 complement=$n11\n   @n10 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"markers\"\n   @n11 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"bit\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$c3\n   @r5 syntax.relation from=$c4 to=$c5\n\n=== n=24 TEXT: name the Sales by month chart Q1 revenue\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"name\" complement=$n1 complement=$n3\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Sales\" head=\"chart\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"by\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"month\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Q1\" head=\"revenue\"\n",
