        "stdout": "=== n=37 TEXT: I need you to make a rectangle labelled Proposal tree; then link Proposal tree to scope; then make Proposal tree orange; then place Proposal tree below scope. I appreciate it.\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"need\" subject=$n1\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$k1\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"make\" subject=$n2 complement=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"rectangle\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"labelled\" complement=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Proposal\" head=\"tree\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"then\" conjunction=\"then\" conjunction=\"then\" conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c4 conjunct=$c5 conjunct=$c6\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"link\" complement=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Proposal\" head=\"tree\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c4 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal head=\"scope\"\n   @c5 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"make\" modifier=\"tree\" modifier=\"orange\" complement=$n7\n   @n7 syntax.nominal head=\"Proposal\"\n   @c6 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"place\" complement=$n8\n   @n8 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Proposal\" head=\"tree\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"below\" from=$c6 to=$n9\n   @n9 syntax.nominal head=\"scope\"\n   @n10 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c7 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"appreciate\" subject=$n10 complement=$n11\n   @n11 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$c3\n\n=== n=38 TEXT: a looking out for me, eye auburn big\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=nonfinite modifier=\"a\" verb=\"looking\" modifier=\"out\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"me\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"eye\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=fragment modifier=\"auburn\" modifier=\"big\" complement=$n2\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=