      "outputText": "=== n=61 TEXT: Main is who the Intro meeting should carry as participants\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"Main\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"is\" subject=$n1\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"who\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Intro\" head=\"meeting\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"should\" verb=\"carry\" subject=$n3 complement=$n2\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"as\" from=$c2 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"participants\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n\n=== n=62 TEXT: turn bold on for characters 10 to 15 of Body\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"turn\" modifier=\"bold\" modifier=\"on\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"characters\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"10\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"to\" head=\"15\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n1 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"Body\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$n3\n\n=== n=63 TEXT: a pointed for me, ear olive\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"a\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=fragment modifier=\"pointed\" complement=$n1\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"me\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"ear\" head=\"olive\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n3\n\n=== n=64 TEXT: and Claims by month on the revenue trend needs the same yellow fading to red, please\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative discourse=\"and\" verb=\"needs\" discourse=\"please\" subject=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"Claims\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"by\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"month\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"on\" from=$c1 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"revenue\" head=\"trend\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"same\" head=\"yellow\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"fading\" subject=$n4\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c2 to=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"red\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n\n=== n=65 TEXT: reschedule Review, 2026-11-18 at 10:00 UTC\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"reschedule\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"Review\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"2026-11-18\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"at\" from=$c1 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"10:00\" head=\"UTC\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\n\n=== n=66 TEXT: get the dog on the lawn to chase the cat, and leave everything else in the picture untouched — the way the drawing looks so far\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"get\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"dog\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"on\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"lawn\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$c2\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"chase\" complement=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"cat\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c3\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"leave\" modifier=\"untouched\" complement=$n4 complement=$n6\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"everything\" dependent=\"else\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$n4 to=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"picture\"\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"way\"\n   @n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"drawing\"\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"looks\" modifier=\"so\" modifier=\"far\" subject=$n7\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n6 to=$c4\n\n=== n=67 TEXT: for the monthly ops review on Friday I need the revenue trend legible from the back of the conference room, so how about line thinner?; also let's have the marker borders thicker on the revenue trend before we circulate it wider; plus show both grid lines\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"monthly\" dependent=\"ops\" head=\"review\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"Friday\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=interrogative verb=\"need\" modifier=\"legible\" subject=$n3 complement=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"revenue\" head=\"trend\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"from\" from=$c1 to=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"back\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n5 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"conference\" head=\"room\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"so\" conjunction=\"plus\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c3 conjunct=$c6\n   @n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"how\" dependent=\"about\" head=\"line\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=fragment modifier=\"thinner\" complement=$n7 ellipsis=$c1\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=imperative modifier=\"also\" verb=\"let\" complement=$n8\n   @n8 syntax.nominal head=\"'s\"\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"have\" modifier=\"thicker\" complement=$n9\n   @n9 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"marker\" head=\"borders\"\n   @r5 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"on\" from=$c4 to=$n10\n   @n10 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"revenue\" head=\"trend\"\n   @r6 syntax.relation marker=\"before\" from=$c4 to=$c5\n   @n11 syntax.nominal head=\"we\"\n   @c5 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"circulate\" modifier=\"wider\" subject=$n11 complement=$n12\n   @n12 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @c6 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"show\" complement=$n13\n   @n13 syntax.nominal dependent=\"both\" dependent=\"grid\" head=\"lines\"\n   @r7 syntax.relation from=$c3 to=$c4\n\n=== n=68 TEXT: same as last step exept with objects 3 and 4\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=fragment modifier=\"same\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"as\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"last\" head=\"step\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"exept\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$n2 to=$k1\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"objects\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"3\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n3 conjunct=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"4\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$n4\n\n=== n=69 TEXT: perhaps you could seat a green block in the middle of the top row and in the second column of red blocks\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"perhaps\" auxiliary=\"could\" verb=\"seat\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"green\" head=\"block\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$c1 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"middle\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n3 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"top\" head=\"row\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$r1 conjunct=$r3\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$c1 to=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"second\" head=\"column\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n5 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"red\" head=\"blocks\"\n\n=== n=70 TEXT: draw a small sun partly hidden behind the tree, not in front of it.\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"draw\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"small\" head=\"sun\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite modifier=\"partly\" verb=\"hidden\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"behind\" from=$c2 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"tree\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation negation=\"not\" marker=\"in\" from=$c2 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"front\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n3 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$c2\n\n=== n=71 TEXT: put a box between Draft ant Review\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"put\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"box\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"between\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Draft\" dependent=\"ant\" head=\"Review\"\n\n=== n=72 TEXT: let's have the font smaler on the profit chart and then set the error bar cap size smaller, that's the tweak\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"let\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"'s\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"have\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=nonfinite modifier=\"the\" verb=\"smaler\" complement=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"font\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$c3 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"profit\" head=\"chart\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c4\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=nonfinite modifier=\"then\" verb=\"set\" modifier=\"smaller\" complement=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"error\" dependent=\"bar\" dependent=\"cap\" head=\"size\"\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"that\"\n   @c5 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"'s\" subject=$n5 complement=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"tweak\"\n   @k2 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c5\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$k1\n   @r3 syntax.relation from=$c2 to=$c3\n",
