      "outputText": "=== n=73 TEXT: instead, a small dog down at the bottom, next clear the top two of the five green blocks, leaving the bottom three exactly as they are — keep the rest as it is\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=fragment modifier=\"instead\" modifier=\"down\" modifier=\"next\" modifier=\"clear\" complement=$n1 complement=$n3\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"small\" head=\"dog\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"at\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"bottom\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"top\" head=\"two\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n3 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"five\" dependent=\"green\" head=\"blocks\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"leaving\" modifier=\"exactly\" complement=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"bottom\" head=\"three\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"as\" from=$c2 to=$c3\n   @n6 syntax.nominal head=\"they\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"are\" subject=$n6\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"keep\" complement=$n7\n   @n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"rest\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"as\" from=$c4 to=$c5\n   @n8 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @c5 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"is\" subject=$n8\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c4\n   @r5 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$c2\n\n=== n=74 TEXT: add the Cool, Grind, Sort chain after Sift, arrows and all\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"add\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Cool\" dependent=\"Grind\" dependent=\"Sort\" head=\"chain\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"after\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"Sift\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"arrows\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"all\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$k2 ellipsis=$c1\n   @k2 syntax.coordination conjunct=$n3 conjunct=$n4\n\n=== n=75 TEXT: mid-move: object Intro relocates to 260, 240\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"mid\" modifier=\"move\" verb=\"relocates\" subject=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"object\" head=\"Intro\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"260\" head=\"240\"\n\n=== n=76 TEXT: instead, a small dog down at the bottom, next shift the BMW block down and a little left past the Esso block, lining it up above the Shell block, then shift the BMW block left until it is in line with the Target block below — keep the rest as it is\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative modifier=\"instead\" verb=\"keep\" complement=$n11\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"small\" head=\"dog\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=fragment modifier=\"down\" complement=$n1\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"at\" from=$c2 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"bottom\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=imperative modifier=\"next\" verb=\"shift\" modifier=\"down\" discourse=\"and\" modifier=\"a\" modifier=\"little\" modifier=\"left\" complement=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"BMW\" head=\"block\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"past\" from=$c3 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Esso\" head=\"block\"\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"lining\" modifier=\"up\" complement=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"above\" from=$c4 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Shell\" head=\"block\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"then\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c3 conjunct=$c5\n   @c5 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"shift\" modifier=\"left\" complement=$n7\n   @n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"BMW\" head=\"block\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"until\" from=$c5 to=$c6\n   @n8 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @c6 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"is\" subject=$n8\n   @r5 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$c6 to=$n9\n   @n9 syntax.nominal head=\"line\"\n   @r6 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$n9 to=$n10\n   @n10 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Target\" head=\"block\" dependent=\"below\"\n   @n11 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"rest\"\n   @r7 syntax.relation marker=\"as\" from=$c1 to=$c7\n   @n12 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @c7 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"is\" subject=$n12\n   @r8 syntax.relation from=$c3 to=$c4\n\n=== n=77 TEXT: put a boy about the same size as the bear\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"put\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"boy\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"about\" dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"same\" head=\"size\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"as\" from=$n2 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"bear\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\n\n=== n=78 TEXT: same thing as step one except with the second figure\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"same\" head=\"thing\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"as\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"step\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"one\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"except with\" from=$n1 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"second\" head=\"figure\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1\n   @r3 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$n3\n\n=== n=79 TEXT: halve teh Shelve label size\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"halve\" dependent=\"teh\" dependent=\"Shelve\" dependent=\"label\" head=\"size\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1\n\n=== n=80 TEXT: Please, make a bar chart called Survey ratings with values 15, 15 for 1 star and Sample. Thanks!\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"Please\" verb=\"make\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"bar\" head=\"chart\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"called\" complement=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Survey\" head=\"ratings\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$n1 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"values\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"15\" dependent=\"15\" dependent=\"for\" dependent=\"1\" head=\"star\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n4 conjunct=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"Sample\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=fragment discourse=\"Thanks\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$c2\n   @r3 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$k1\n\n=== n=81 TEXT: Thu two 120\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"Thu\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"two\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"120\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1\n   @r1 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n3\n\n=== n=82 TEXT: In the Budget table, change the cells to Item, Cost / Venue, 1500 / Catering, 900.\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"In\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Budget\" head=\"table\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"change\" complement=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"cells\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"Item\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Cost\" head=\"Venue\"\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"1500\" head=\"Catering\"\n   @n6 syntax.nominal head=\"900\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$n4\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n4 to=$n5\n   @r5 syntax.relation from=$n4 to=$n6\n\n=== n=83 TEXT: Given that the lock was supposed to flatten the overlay, is there a rectangle still stuck in it regardless?\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=interrogative modifier=\"Given\" verb=\"is\" subject=$n3 complement=$n4\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"that\" from=$c1 to=$c2\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"lock\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"was\" verb=\"supposed\" subject=$n1\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c2 to=$c3\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"flatten\" complement=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"overlay\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"there\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"rectangle\"\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=nonfinite modifier=\"still\" verb=\"stuck\" modifier=\"regardless\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$c4 to=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n4 to=$c4\n\n=== n=84 TEXT: tie Start, n 1, and support\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"tie\" complement=$k1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"Start\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"n\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"1\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n1 conjunct=$n2 conjunct=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"support\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$n3\n",
