      "outputText": "=== n=85 TEXT: repeat step two with the fourth and fifth figures and then tell me the count\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"repeat\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"step\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"two\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"with\" from=$c1 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"fourth\" dependent=\"and\" dependent=\"fifth\" head=\"figures\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=imperative modifier=\"then\" verb=\"tell\" complement=$n4 complement=$n5\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"me\"\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"count\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\n\n=== n=86 TEXT: add a chart with type radar and title Quarterly plan and labels North, South and East and values 3, 5 and 8 and source calendar\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"add\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"chart\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$n1 to=$k1\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"type\" head=\"radar\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n2 conjunct=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"title\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Quarterly\" head=\"plan\"\n   @k2 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n4 conjunct=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"labels\"\n   @n6 syntax.nominal head=\"North\"\n   @n7 syntax.nominal head=\"South\"\n   @k3 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n6 conjunct=$n7 conjunct=$n8\n   @n8 syntax.nominal head=\"East\"\n   @k4 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n   @n9 syntax.nominal head=\"values\"\n   @n10 syntax.nominal head=\"3\"\n   @n11 syntax.nominal head=\"5\"\n   @n12 syntax.nominal head=\"8\"\n   @k5 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n10 conjunct=$n11 conjunct=$n12\n   @n13 syntax.nominal dependent=\"source\" head=\"calendar\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$k6 ellipsis=$c1\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$k2\n   @r3 syntax.relation from=$n5 to=$k3\n   @k6 syntax.coordination conjunct=$n9 conjunct=$n13\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n9 to=$k5\n\n=== n=87 TEXT: change a meteing Main Track 3 1 Review\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"change\" dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"meteing\" dependent=\"3\" dependent=\"1\" head=\"Review\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Main\" head=\"Track\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1 complement=$n2\n\n=== n=88 TEXT: right, for the board meeting make a pie chart of the results, Chat uh 5; Phone 5, Email 85\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"right\" verb=\"make\" complement=$n2\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"board\" head=\"meeting\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"pie\" head=\"chart\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n2 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"results\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"Chat\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=fragment discourse=\"uh\" complement=$n4\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"5\"\n   @n6 syntax.nominal head=\"Phone\"\n   @n7 syntax.nominal head=\"5\"\n   @n8 syntax.nominal head=\"Email\"\n   @n9 syntax.nominal head=\"85\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c3\n   @r3 syntax.relation from=$n4 to=$n5\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n6\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n6 to=$n7\n   @r5 syntax.relation from=$n6 to=$n8\n   @r6 syntax.relation from=$n8 to=$n9\n\n=== n=89 TEXT: Somewhere on that slide there should be a bar chart titled Intro, labels Main, values Second\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"Somewhere\" auxiliary=\"should\" verb=\"be\" subject=$n2 complement=$n3\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"that\" head=\"slide\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"there\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"bar\" head=\"chart\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"titled\" complement=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"Intro\"\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"labels\"\n   @n6 syntax.nominal head=\"Main\"\n   @n7 syntax.nominal head=\"values\"\n   @n8 syntax.nominal head=\"Second\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$c2\n   @r3 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$n5\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$n7\n   @r5 syntax.relation from=$n5 to=$n6\n   @r6 syntax.relation from=$n7 to=$n8\n\n=== n=90 TEXT: the man in the orange jacket and blue hat to the right end, and then the boy in the purple jacket and red hat between the middle and the right end\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"man\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$n1 to=$k1\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"orange\" head=\"jacket\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n2 conjunct=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"blue\" head=\"hat\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$n1 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"right\" head=\"end\"\n   @k2 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n1 conjunct=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"then\" dependent=\"the\" head=\"boy\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$n5 to=$k3\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"purple\" head=\"jacket\"\n   @k3 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n6 conjunct=$n7\n   @n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"red\" head=\"hat\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"between\" from=$n5 to=$k4\n   @n8 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"middle\"\n   @k4 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n8 conjunct=$n9\n   @n9 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"right\" head=\"end\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$k2\n\n=== n=91 TEXT: rotate upside dwn\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"rotate\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"upside\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"dwn\" complement=$n2\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c1\n\n=== n=92 TEXT: I changed my mind: the diagram I have open.\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"changed\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"my\" head=\"mind\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"diagram\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"have\" subject=$n4\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=fragment modifier=\"open\" complement=$n3\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c3\n   @r1 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$c2\n\n=== n=93 TEXT: here is the plan: the inheritance arrows hollow, plus mark the parent class at the arrow tail, so it still fits on a single slide without crowding\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"here\" verb=\"is\" subject=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"plan\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"inheritance\" head=\"arrows\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"hollow\" subject=$n2\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"plus\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c3\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"mark\" complement=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"parent\" head=\"class\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"at\" from=$c3 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"arrow\" head=\"tail\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"so\" from=$c3 to=$c4\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"still\" verb=\"fits\" subject=$n5\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$c4 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"single\" head=\"slide\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"without\" from=$c4 to=$c5\n   @c5 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"crowding\"\n\n=== n=94 TEXT: I want the long bench a bit closer to the path, and leave the path clear.\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"want\" modifier=\"closer\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2 complement=$n3\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"long\" head=\"bench\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"bit\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"path\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"leave\" modifier=\"clear\" complement=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"path\"\n\n=== n=95 TEXT: right, for readers who skim I'd like the first paragraph moved before the chapter heading, with the remaining blocks in order\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative discourse=\"right\" auxiliary=\"'d\" verb=\"like\" subject=$n2\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"readers\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"who\" from=$n1 to=$c2\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"skim\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"first\" head=\"paragraph\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"moved\" subject=$n3\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"before\" from=$c3 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"chapter\" head=\"heading\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$c3 to=$c4\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"remaining\" head=\"blocks\"\n   @r5 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$n5 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal head=\"order\"\n   @r6 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c3\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n5\n\n=== n=96 TEXT: create a timeline of the hiring rounds, left to right, with even gaps between the ticks\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"create\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"timeline\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"hiring\" head=\"rounds\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"left\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$n3 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"right\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"with\" from=$c1 to=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"even\" head=\"gaps\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"between\" from=$n5 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"ticks\"\n   @r5 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n3\n",
