        "stdout": "=== n=121 TEXT: draw the diagram, then check the profit area is above zero\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"draw\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"diagram\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"then\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"check\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"profit\" head=\"area\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"is\" subject=$n2\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"above\" from=$c3 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"zero\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$c2 to=$c3\n\n=== n=122 TEXT: would you make that one look nicer\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"would\" verb=\"make\" subject=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"that\" head=\"one\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"look\" modifier=\"nicer\" subject=$n2\n   @r1 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n\n=== n=123 TEXT: slide block 15 under block 2, then slide block 15 left to block 14\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"slide\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"block\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"15\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"under\" from=$n1 to=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"block\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"2\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"then\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c3\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"slide\" head=\"block\"\n   @n6 syntax.nominal head=\"15\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"left\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$n5 to=$n7\n   @n7 syntax.nominal head=\"block\"\n   @n8 syntax.nominal head=\"14\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n5 ellipsis=$c1\n   @r3 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$n4\n   @r5 syntax.relation from=$n5 to=$c2\n   @r6 syntax.relation from=$n5 to=$n6\n   @r7 syntax.relation from=$n7 to=$n8\n\n=== n=124 TEXT: create a scatter chart called Sales 4 for