        "stdout": "=== n=142 TEXT: the junior pulled the figures together overnight and left the revenue trend looking unfinished round the edges, so make the lines on the claims chart distinct colours and I'll take it from there, and make the font a bit bigger\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"junior\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"pulled\" modifier=\"together\" modifier=\"overnight\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"figures\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunction=\"so\" conjunction=\"and\" conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c4 conjunct=$c5 conjunct=$c6\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"left\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"revenue\" head=\"trend\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"looking\" modifier=\"unfinished\" subject=$n3\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"round\" from=$c3 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"edges\"\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"make\" complement=$n5 complement=$n7\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"lines\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$n5 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"claims\" head=\"chart\"\n   @n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"distinct\" head=\"colours\"\n   @n8 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c5 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"'ll\" verb=\"take\" subject=$n8 complement=$n9\n   @n9 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"from\" from=$c5 to=$n10\n   @n10 syntax.nominal head=\"there\"\n   @c6 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"make\" modifier=\"bigger\" complement=$n11 complement=$n12\n   @n11 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"font\"\n   @n12 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"bit\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation from=$c2 to=$c3\n\n=== n=143 TEXT: when the regions dial in tomorrow the first chart they see is Claims by month, so for their sake make the markers black before the meeting starts, and give it the title Claims history\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"when\" from=$c3 to=$c1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"regions\"\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"dial\" modifier=\"in\" modifier=\"tomorrow\" subject=$n1\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"first\" head=\"chart\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"they\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"see\" subject=$n3\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"is\" subject=$n2 complement=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"Claims\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"by\" from=$n4 to=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"month\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"so\" from=$c3 to=$k1\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c4 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"their\" head=\"sake\"\n   @c4 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"make\" modifier=\"black\" complement=$n7\n   @n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"markers\"\n   @r5 syntax.relation marker=\"before\" from=$c4 to=$c5\n   @n8 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"meeting\"\n   @c5 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"starts\" subject=$n8\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c4 conjunct=$c6\n   @c6 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"give\" complement=$n9 complement=$n10\n   @n9 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n   @n10 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"title\"\n   @n11 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Claims\" head=\"history\"\n   @r6 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$c2\n   @r7 syntax.relation from=$n10 to=$n11\n\n=== n=144 TEXT: and also let's restore the arrow size to one step smaller\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"and\" modifier=\"also\" verb=\"let\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"'s\"\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"restore\" complement=$n2 complement=$n3\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"arrow\" head=\"size\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c2 to=$n4\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"one\" head=\"step\"\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"smaller\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n\n=== n=145 TEXT: bring the man in the green shirt level with the man in the orange shirt with the red hat\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"bring\" complement=$n1 complement=$n3\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"man\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"green\" head=\"shirt\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"level\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"with\" from=$c1 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"man\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$n4 to=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"orange\" head=\"shirt\"\n   @r4 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$n5 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"red\" head=\"hat\"\n\n=== n=146 TEXT: set one paragraph Deep Dive left Summary\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"set\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"one\" head=\"paragraph\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Deep\" dependent=\"Dive\" dependent=\"left\" head=\"Summary\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\n\n=== n=147 TEXT: Don't keep them on screen, but flash the IDs quickly so I can note the diamond's\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative auxiliary=\"Do\" negation=\"n't\" verb=\"keep\" complement=$n1\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"them\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"screen\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"but\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"flash\" modifier=\"quickly\" complement=$n3\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"IDs\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"so\" from=$c2 to=$c3\n   @n4 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n   @c3 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"can\" verb=\"note\" subject=$n4 complement=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"diamond\" dependent=\"'s\"\n\n=== n=148 TEXT: and again — build a green column between the purple columns, exactly three blocks tall, and then put one blue block on top of each purple tower\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"and\" modifier=\"again\" verb=\"build\" modifier=\"tall\" complement=$n1 complement=$n3\n   @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"green\" head=\"column\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"between\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n   @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"purple\" head=\"columns\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"exactly\" dependent=\"three\" head=\"blocks\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=imperative modifier=\"then\" verb=\"put\" complement=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"one\" dependent=\"blue\" head=\"block\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$c2 to=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"top\"\n   @r3 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n5 to=$n6\n   @n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"each\" dependent=\"purple\" head=\"tower\"\n\n=== n=149 TEXT: maybe you could slide block 1 to the bottom, then slide block 1 right until it is just short of block 12, then slide block 1 up until it almost touches block 7, then slide block 1 left until it is clear of block 4\n   @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"maybe\" auxiliary=\"could\" verb=\"slide\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n   @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n   @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"block\"\n   @n3 syntax.nominal head=\"1\"\n   @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$n4\n   @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"bottom\"\n   @k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"then\" conjunction=\"then\" conjunction=\"then\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c4 conjunct=$c6\n   @c2 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"slide\" modifier=\"right\" complement=$n5\n   @n5 syntax.nominal head=\"block\"\n   @n6 syntax.nominal head=\"1\"\n   @r2 syntax.relation mark